# DrugIQ – Services Directory

Business logic and data-access services live here.

## Planned Services

| File                    | Description                                      |
|-------------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| `DrugService.js`        | CRUD, search, and aggregation for drugs          |
| `ReviewService.js`      | Review queries, filtering, and analytics         |
| `SideEffectService.js`  | Side-effect aggregation logic                    |
| `ConditionService.js`   | Condition-to-drug mapping                        |
| `AnalyticsService.js`   | Aggregation pipelines for analytics endpoints    |
| `NLPService.js`         | Sentiment scoring and NLP pipeline               |

## Conventions

- Services are pure functions / classes — no `req`/`res` objects.
- Services receive plain data objects and return plain data.
- All database calls use `lean()` for performance (unless Mongoose docs needed).
